# Per-package `pnpm-lock.yaml` files are created as a side effect of
# running `pnpm install` from inside a sub-package directory. The
# workspace's root `pnpm-lock.yaml` is the source of truth, so
# per-package copies are noise and not tracked.
/**/pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
research/similar-projects/
*.tsbuildinfo
